00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:01.880
Subame!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:02.550
Me...

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:03.800
Metamon!

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:20.570
Pikachu!

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:21.400
Usohachi!

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:22.110
Chicorita!

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:22.900
Tamatama!

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:23.650
Mamepato!

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:24.490
Togedemaru!

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:25.240
Lucario!

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:26.030
Odoshishi!

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:26.820
Seadra!

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:27.450
Laplace!

00:22:27.450 --> 00:22:28.280
Starmie!

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:29.080
Miniryu!

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:29.870
Windie!

00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:30.580
Iwark!

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:31.410
Kucheat!

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:32.160
Togekiss!

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:32.910
Sleep!

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:33.660
Ptera!

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:34.500
Raikou!

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:35.250
U'u!

00:22:35.250 --> 00:22:36.040
Wooloo!

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:36.830
Ruriri!

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:37.580
Leafia!

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:38.380
Armorgaw!

00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:39.170
Abagoura!

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:39.960
Latias!

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:40.710
Spear!

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:41.460
