00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:43.300
Madatsubomi!

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:44.460
Mew!

00:23:07.130 --> 00:23:09.570
Now, onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:10.870
Go!

00:23:11.650 --> 00:23:12.610
It’s snowing!

00:23:12.610 --> 00:23:13.200
Let’s have a snowball fight!

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:16.080
Never mind that!
I want to catch Ice-type Pokémon!

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:18.370
I can’t let this chance get away!

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:20.000
Then why not come home with me?

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:24.040
I’d be all alone too,
so you can stay with me.

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:26.450
You could just become
a Koduck’s trainer...

00:23:26.450 --> 00:23:28.720
I’m fine with just watching.

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:30.310
And...

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:32.680
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:34.270
My Love is a Koduck
